<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-9</name><desc>MTB-9 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, some of them handy links between hiking routes. It's 8.3 km from St Cyril and Methodius Church to Konjsko, with about 203 m of climbing and 184 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 846 m and 1,020 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-9/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
